      <title>随着美加贸易战的展开，特朗普威胁对汽车、卡车和钢铁征收新的 50% 关税</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/24/business/economy/trump-canada-tariffs.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[随着两国逐渐走向全面贸易战，特朗普总统誓言从 1 月 1 日起将汽车、卡车、汽车零部件和钢铁的关税提高至 50%。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/24/business/economy/trump-canada-tariffs.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 24 Aug 2026 18:30:30 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
